  "daily_overview": "今日科技界聚焦 AI Agent 迈向真实场景与工业应用，Anthropic 等大厂正推动工程化落地，人形机器人全链路开源成为新风向；财经领域，谷歌因 AI 高额投入导致股价下挫，显示市场对 AI 变现能力的耐心考验，同时欧洲商业地产与中企绿色出口表现各异，全球能源与债务局势依然紧张；时政方面，以色列大选陷入僵局，西班牙发生严重列车脱轨事故，巴西政坛变动引发国际关注。整体而言，AI 正在从技术狂热转向实用性交付，而宏观经济的不确定性正倒逼企业回归效率与现金流管理。In the tech world, the focus shifts toward AI agents in real-world industrial settings, with giants like Anthropic driving engineering adoption and open-source humanoid robotics emerging as a new trend. In finance, Google's stock decline amid heavy AI investment signals testing patience for monetization. Globally, energy, debt crises, and geopolitical tensions—ranging from the Israeli election deadlock to political shifts in Brazil—remain significant concerns. Overall, AI is moving from hype to delivery, while macroeconomic uncertainty forces businesses to prioritize efficiency and cash flow.",
